{
  "manifestVersion": 2,
  "id": "comfyui-hana",
  "name": "Hana-ComfyUI",
  "version": "0.11.2",
  "description": "把本机 ComfyUI（127.0.0.1:8188）接进 Hana：整页工作区内嵌官方前端（工作区 iframe 直连 127.0.0.1:8188，自定义节点扩展脚本的绝对路径也走通），comfyui 工具支持提交工作流/跟踪进度/取回产物/取消/上传/服务起停（service：拉起前环境检查，其他模型占卡/端口残留 → 阻断说明；含 wait 轮询就绪）/本体更新（update）/画布共驾（canvas：读改人正在看的同一张画布——投影·体检·追踪·大纲·patch 事务·排布命令·多页面定向），生成即宿主任务（含回执）；左侧状态面板带 GPU/CPU/内存实时图表、「释放显存」与「启动/停止 ComfyUI 服务」按钮，工作区顶栏常驻服务控制；可自定义 ComfyUI 安装目录（探测/手填），服务由计划任务拉起，独立于 Hana 存活；源码安装可检查/一键更新 ComfyUI 本体（git pull --ff-only + pip install，更新前自动停服务）；未装 ComfyUI 时提供安装引导（选位置 → 让助手装 / 复制指令 / 自行安装）。",
  "entry": "index.js",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "minAppVersion": "0.1013.0",
  "network": {
    "allowedHosts": [
      "127.0.0.1"
    ],
    "methods": [
      "GET"
    ],
    "allowLocalhost": true,
    "defaultTimeoutMs": 5000,
    "maxResponseBytes": 1048576
  },
  "capabilities": [
    "app/runtime.execute",
    "app/runtime.local-machine",
    "app/runtime.network",
    "app/resources.read",
    "app/tools.expose-to-model",
    "app/tasks.manage",
    "app/session.start-turn",
    "app/windows.manage"
  ],
  "ui": {
    "csp": {
      "frameDomains": [
        "http://127.0.0.1:8188"
      ],
      "connectDomains": [
        "http://127.0.0.1:8188",
        "ws://127.0.0.1:8188"
      ]
    }
  },
  "contributes": {
    "cards": [
      {
        "id": "workspace",
        "title": "ComfyUI 工作区",
        "description": "整页工作区：经宿主代理路径内嵌 ComfyUI 官方前端（零改造，相对寻址）",
        "route": "/workspace.html",
        "realization": "page",
        "siteNavEntry": true,
        "fpFullPanel": true,
        "closable": false,
        "cardForm": "flush",
        "titlebar": "solid",
        "functionPanel": {
          "id": "status",
          "label": "ComfyUI 状态",
          "route": "/panel.html"
        },
        "detached": {
          "route": "/workspace.html"
        },
        "face": {
          "image": "assets/cover.png"
        }
      }
    ],
    "settings": {
      "title": "Hana-ComfyUI",
      "ui": {
        "route": "/settings.html"
      }
    }
  }
}
